[  131.6s] - **identity.max_wrong**: OK. "Three wrong answers in total: `unverified` / `failed`." Set to 3, counted in total.
[  131.6s] - **identity.hints**: OK. The API response has no hint field (only ok, error, passed, wrong_left, identity_complete), so `{}` is right.
